ext":"誰か一緒にいこー←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしてもあのヘルメットに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付いてるカメラ恐ろしいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あかん角度だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/0690847/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか私あかんあかん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言い過ぎだったね。うるさかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲームとかしてても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく言ってしまうんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癖だなー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのリアクション見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爆笑しちゃった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果どうなるんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次もお楽しみに♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイクでかかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/22/0690847/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとになめてないよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張るーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-1735":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが日記を書く時間だよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長い。今日は長いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初に。\n昨日アップした「ひめたん(*ゝω・*)ノその4」が\nデコメ貼れてなかったり\nいこまっちが\nいこまっちになってたり\nほんとに寝ぼけてま